### Latest physical season, club population
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking
Accept: application/json

### Canonical season scope (fallback seasons disclosed per component)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?scope=season-2026&page=1&limit=10

### Physical season and participant filtering
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?season=2026&participant_kind=national

### Canonical national participant kind (equivalent to national alias)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?season=2026&participant_kind=national_team

### Competition participation filter and literal case-insensitive name
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?season=2026&competition_id=3&name=Real

### Pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?season=2026&page=2&limit=10

### No observations (empty or unknown components, never invented data)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?season=1990

### Invalid mutually exclusive selectors: 422
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?season=2026&scope=season-2026

### Unsupported award/tournament scope: 422
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?scope=world-cup-2026

### Invalid season: 422
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?season=2026-29

### Invalid limit: 422
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?limit=51

### Invalid participant kind: 422
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/teams/ranking?participant_kind=unknown
